#: ../../modules/utils/utils_overview.rst:2
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Visió general"

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_overview.rst:4
msgid ""
"The :mod:`qilisdk.utils` module collects the supporting tools that the rest "
"of the SDK is built on. Nothing here describes a quantum process of its own:"
" these are just useful tools to support the rest of the SDK:"
msgstr ""
"El mòdul :mod:`qilisdk.utils` aplega les eines de suport sobre les quals es "
"construeix la resta del SDK. Res del que hi ha aquí descriu un procés "
"quàntic propi: són simplement eines útils que donen suport a la resta del "
"SDK:"

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_overview.rst:7
msgid ""
":doc:`utils_classical_solvers` provides a common interface to brute force, "
"SciPy, simulated annealing and SCIP, so that any "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.model.Model` can be solved classically for reference."
msgstr ""
":doc:`utils_classical_solvers` proporciona una interfície comuna per a la "
"força bruta, SciPy, el recuit simulat i SCIP, de manera que qualsevol "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.model.Model` es pugui resoldre de forma clàssica com a"
" referència."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_overview.rst:8
msgid ""
":doc:`utils_interoperability` converts circuits and Hamiltonians to and from"
" OpenQASM, QIR and OpenFermion."
msgstr ""
":doc:`utils_interoperability` converteix circuits i hamiltonians cap a i des"
" d'OpenQASM, QIR i OpenFermion."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_overview.rst:9
msgid ""
":doc:`utils_serialization` writes any QiliSDK object to YAML and reads it "
"back, and provides the stable hash used throughout the SDK."
msgstr ""
":doc:`utils_serialization` escriu qualsevol objecte de QiliSDK en YAML i el "
"torna a llegir, i proporciona el hash estable que s'utilitza a tot el SDK."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_overview.rst:11
msgid ""
"Unlike the other modules, :mod:`qilisdk.utils` has no top-level re-exports: "
"each submodule is imported by its full path."
msgstr ""
"A diferència dels altres mòduls, :mod:`qilisdk.utils` no reexporta res al "
"seu nivell superior: cada submòdul s'importa per la seva ruta completa."
